Changes:
- Add hospital selector (cascading dropdown) to demographics step
- Add provinsiDetail, namaRS, hospitalId to survey schema
- 100 selected hospitals data in hospitals.ts
- Dashboard page (/dashboard) with auth:
  - Strata quota tracking with progress bars
  - Per-RS status table (sortable, filterable)
  - Per-province stats
  - Profesi distribution
  - Auto-refresh every 30s
  - CSV export endpoint
- Login page with password auth via middleware
- Supabase migration v2: hospitals table, quota_targets, new response columns
- Updated step-review to show new fields
